# Timestamped serverless.yml snapshots taken before manual edits.
# Historical only. Verified 2026-07-10 against amplify-prod-lambda-prod that
# the logical-ID rename these snapshots predate (AccountingTable ->
# AccountingChargesDynamoDbTable, S3AccessLogsBucket -> AccessLogsBucket) is
# ALREADY applied in prod, so they record nothing the live stack does not.
# Safe to delete; ignored so they never reach a commit.
*.backup
*.backup2
*.backup-*
